IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-TREASURY-LORE-HOLDINGS.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOKEN-INDEX PIC 99 USAGE R0.
01 BALANCE-HIGH PIC 9(18) USAGE R1.
01 BALANCE-LOW PIC 9(18) USAGE R2.
01 SUPPLY-HIGH PIC 9(18) USAGE R3.
01 SUPPLY-LOW PIC 9(18) USAGE R4.
01 TOKEN-DECIMALS PIC 99 USAGE R5.
01 K-EXPONENT PIC 9 USAGE R6.
01 STATUS-CODE PIC 9 USAGE R7.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 3 TO K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 1 TO TOKEN-INDEX.
    PERFORM VERIFY-ALL-TOKENS.
    IF STATUS-CODE == 0
        SET depth 5.
    ELSE
        SET depth 1.
    END-IF.
    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

VERIFY-ALL-TOKENS.
    PERFORM UNTIL TOKEN-INDEX > 21
        PERFORM VERIFY-SINGLE-TOKEN
        ADD 1 TO TOKEN-INDEX
    END-PERFORM.
    EXIT.

VERIFY-SINGLE-TOKEN.
    IF K-EXPONENT != 3
        MOVE 1 TO STATUS-CODE
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO STATUS-CODE
    END-IF.
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
